                </div>
                <div class="workbench-body" id="workbench-body">
                    <section id="workbench-panel-filters" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="workbench-tab-filters" data-panel="filters" class="workbench-section filters-panel" hidden><h2>Find events</h2><p>Apply filters browses bounded pages. Search retained files runs a separate fixed-snapshot query using all fields below. Exact IDs match parsed fields; literal text ignores case.</p>
                <form class="log-filters" onsubmit="applyFilters(event)" aria-label="Exact event filters">
